# FRACTINT | ; Roger Penrose's kites and darts
# FRACTINT |   Angle 10
# FRACTINT |   Axiom WG+XG+WG+XG+WG+XG+WG+XG+WG+X
# FRACTINT |   W=[F][++@1.618033989F][++G---@.618033989G|X-Y|G|W]
# FRACTINT |   X=[F+++@1.618033989F][++@.618033989GZ|X|-G|W]
# FRACTINT |   Y=[+F][@1.618033989F][+G@.618033989|Y+X]
# FRACTINT |   Z=[-F][@1.618033989F][@.618033989G--WG|+Z]
# FRACTINT |   F=
# FRACTINT |   }
